WEBVTT

00:11:01.316 --> 00:11:05.436
But I would just encourage you
to try to be experimental

00:11:05.476 --> 00:11:09.036
when it comes to interacting
with these algorithms.

00:11:09.516 --> 00:11:13.676
Because if you just do the defaults,

00:11:13.716 --> 00:11:15.836
follow your preference,

00:11:15.836 --> 00:11:20.396
go in the direction
that everything else is going,

00:11:20.436 --> 00:11:23.836
it's really easy to get caught
in a place where you can be controlled.

00:11:24.356 --> 00:11:26.916
And I think that's it.

00:11:26.956 --> 00:11:28.116
Thank you.

00:11:28.116 --> 00:11:32.276
(Applause)